id: PATO:0000915
name: thickness
def: "A 1-D extent quality which is equal to the dimension through an object as opposed to its length or width." [WordNet:WordNet]
comment: Thickness often refers to the smallest 1-D extent compared to the other two orthogonal dimensions, however, this is not always true. See https://github.com/pato-ontology/pato/issues/337 for full discussion.
subset: attribute_slim
subset: scalar_slim
is_a: PATO:0001708 ! 1-D extent
property_value: seeAlso "https://github.com/pato-ontology/pato/issues/337" xsd:string

