[Term]
id: PATO:0000921
name: width
def: "A 1-D extent quality which is equal to the distance from one side of an object to another side which is opposite." [PATOC:GVG]
comment: Width often refers to the dimension that is greater than the extent in only one of the other two orthogonal dimensions, however, this is not always true. See https://github.com/pato-ontology/pato/issues/337 for full discussion.
subset: attribute_slim
subset: scalar_slim
synonym: "breadth" RELATED []
